/.idea
/.claude
/_ignored
CLAUDE.md

# Build outputs and runtime state of the examples. None of this belongs in the repo: a fresh
# clone should build its own, and a committed build/ leaves stale jars and Gradle report files
# lying around for the next reader.
/examples/*/build/
/examples/*/target/
/examples/*/.gradle/
/examples/*/FRONTCACHE_HOME/cache/
/examples/*/FRONTCACHE_HOME/logs/

# Generated by benchmark/extract-requests.js from a request log — tens/hundreds of MB, and a
# dump of real production traffic. Regenerate it, never commit it. Saved reports in
# benchmark/results/ are small text files and are worth keeping.
/benchmark/requests/
